        "content": "{\"content\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"{\\n    \\\"verdict\\\": \\\"pass\\\",\\n    \\\"issues\\\": [\\n        \\\"No major factual issues found in the proposed answer\\\",\\n        \\\"Content aligns well with authoritative sources\\\",\\n        \\\"Structure and components are accurately represented\\\"\\n    ],\\n    \\\"next_action\\\": \\\"The answer can be used as-is, though could potentially be enhanced with more specific examples of financial metrics and ratios to include\\\",\\n    \\\"current_response\\\": {\\n        \\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\",\\n        \\\"content\\\": \\\"To construct an equity research report, follow these key steps and components:\\n\\n1. Executive Summary\\n- Clear buy/sell/hold recommendation and target price\\n- Brief overview of key findings and investment thesis\\n- Keep concise (1-2 pages)\\n\\n2. Company Overview\\n- Business model description\\n- Management team analysis\\n- Market position and competitive landscape\\n- Industry analysis using frameworks like Porter's Five Forces\\n\\n3. Financial Analysis\\n- Historical performance review\\n- Financial statements analysis\\n- Key ratios and metrics\\n- Future projections and modeling\\n- Working capital and cash flow analysis\\n\\n4. Valuation\\n- Multiple valuation methods (DCF, comparables, multiples)\\n- Clear explanation of assumptions\\n- Sensitivity analysis\\n- Target price derivation\\n\\n5. Risk Assessment\\n- Company-specific risks\\n- Industry risks\\n- Macroeconomic factors\\n- Regulatory considerations\\n\\n6. Investment Thesis\\n- Clear articulation of recommendation rationale\\n- Growth drivers and catalysts\\n- Key differentiators\\n\\nBest Practices:\\n- Keep report length to 10-15 pages\\n- Include visual aids (charts, graphs)\\n- Use clear, actionable language\\n- Include proper disclaimers\\n- Regular updates as needed\\n- Consider ESG factors\\n- Validate all data sources\\n\\nThe report should be structured to help investors make informed decisions while maintaining professional standards and analytical rigor.\\\"\\n    }\\n}\"}], \"usage\": {\"input_tokens\": 34917, \"output_tokens\": 419, \"total_tokens\": 35336}, \"metadata\": {\"team_id\": \"team_the_great_hack_2025_015\", \"model\": \"us.anthropic.claude-3-5-sonnet-20241022-v2:0\", \"cost_usd\": 0.111036, \"latency_ms\": 11624.84, \"remaining_quota\": {\"requests_today\": 855, \"tokens_today\": 3554448, \"llm_cost\": 24.351345, \"gpu_cost\": 0.0, \"total_cost\": 24.351345, \"budget_limit\": 50.0, \"remaining_budget\": 25.648655, \"budget_usage_percent\": 48.70269}}}",
